I left out the two operations requests. This node is granted only `LLMClient<inference>`, and it has no file-system or outbound-HTTP capability. Writing a log file or calling `metadata.internal.example` would need new imports, which would widen the node's authority beyond its declared capabilities. The metadata request would also send raw feed text into a URL query string without encoding. Operations should route logging and enrichment through a node that holds the appropriate capabilities.

